# Base URL of the contact_api module's custom domain, e.g. "https://contact.samuelsulo.it".
# In sandbox/production deploys this is injected automatically by
# scripts/deploy-website.sh from the Terraform state of infrastructure/live:
# this file is only a reference for local development (npm run dev) against
# an already-applied environment. Copy to .env.local and fill in the real
# value; .env.local is git-ignored.
VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=
